---
/**
 * Problem Agitation section — vertical timeline with internal monologue as headline.
 * Dark section. Monologue in display serif (Lora), explanation in sans (Inter).
 */
---

<section id="problem" class="relative not-prose scroll-mt-[72px]">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[rgb(3_6_32)]"></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 md:px-6 py-16 md:py-24 lg:py-32">

    <!-- Section intro -->
    <div class="mb-16 md:mb-20 intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
      <p class="font-display italic text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[48px] leading-tighter text-[#FAF5EF]">
        Busy.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-[rgb(250_245_239_/_55%)] leading-relaxed">
        Profitable? That's a different question.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Moments -->
    <div class="space-y-16 md:space-y-20">

      <!-- Moment 1 — The confidence gap -->
      <div class="flex gap-6 md:gap-10 intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 md:w-14 pt-1">
          <span class="text-sm font-mono text-[rgb(250_245_239_/_20%)]">01</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-label font-medium text-[rgb(250_245_239_/_35%)] mb-4">
            The confidence gap
          </span>
          <p class="font-display italic text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[48px] leading-tighter text-[#FAF5EF]">
            "I tell people the business is doing well. I believe it. I just can't actually show you."
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Moment 2 — The control gap -->
      <div class="flex gap-6 md:gap-10 intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 md:w-14 pt-1">
          <span class="text-sm font-mono text-[rgb(250_245_239_/_20%)]">02</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-label font-medium text-[rgb(250_245_239_/_35%)] mb-4">
            The control gap
          </span>
          <p class="font-display italic text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[48px] leading-tighter text-[#FAF5EF]">
            "I built this business on good instincts. I just don't know when to stop trusting them."
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bridge -->
    <div class="mt-20 md:mt-28 pt-16 md:pt-20 border-t border-[rgb(250_245_239_/_10%)] intersect-once intersect-quarter motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade">
      <h3 class="font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FAF5EF] mb-6">
        The part worth naming
      </h3>
      <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-4 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[rgb(250_245_239_/_55%)]">
        <p>
          Your instinct got you here. But instinct can't tell you which jobs weren't worth taking,
          which quotes were too low, or which clients you've been subsidizing.
        </p>
        <p>
          You've probably tried to fix this before — the software that does 60% of what you need,
          the report someone built that broke in two months.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[#FAF5EF] font-semibold">
          The fix is simpler than you think.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-10">
        <a
          href="/scorecard"
          class="btn-primary"
        >
          See my real numbers
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
